{"slug":"e-z-z","ar":"ع ز ز","total":119,"core":"might; honor","forms":[{"ar":"عَزِيز","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":101,"gloss":"The Mighty","word":"al-azeez","ex":{"s":36,"a":5,"p":2,"ar":["تَنزِيلَ","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلرَّحِيمِ"],"en":"[This is] a revelation of the Exalted in Might, the Merciful"}},{"ar":"عِزَّة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":11,"gloss":"might, honor; pride","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":82,"p":2,"ar":["قَالَ","فَبِعِزَّتِكَ","لَأُغْوِيَنَّهُمْ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"en":"[Iblees] said, \"By your might, I will surely mislead them all"}},{"ar":"أَعَزّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"mightier, more honorable","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":34,"p":12,"ar":["وَكَانَ","لَهُۥ","ثَمَرٌ","فَقَالَ","لِصَـٰحِبِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","يُحَاوِرُهُۥٓ","أَنَا۠","أَكْثَرُ","مِنكَ","مَالًا","وَأَعَزُّ","نَفَرًا"],"en":"And he had fruit, so he said to his companion while he was conversing with him, \"I am greater than you in wealth and mightier in [numbers of] men"}},{"ar":"عَزَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to overpower","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":23,"p":13,"ar":["إِنَّ","هَـٰذَآ","أَخِى","لَهُۥ","تِسْعٌ","وَتِسْعُونَ","نَعْجَةً","وَلِىَ","نَعْجَةٌ","وَٰحِدَةٌ","فَقَالَ","أَكْفِلْنِيهَا","وَعَزَّنِى","فِى","ٱلْخِطَابِ"],"en":"Indeed this, my brother, has ninety-nine ewes, and I have one ewe; so he said, 'Entrust her to me,' and he overpowered me in speech"}},{"ar":"عَزَّزْ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"to strengthen","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":14,"p":6,"ar":["إِذْ","أَرْسَلْنَآ","إِلَيْهِمُ","ٱثْنَيْنِ","فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا","فَعَزَّزْنَا","بِثَالِثٍ","فَقَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّآ","إِلَيْكُم","مُّرْسَلُونَ"],"en":"When We sent to them two but they denied them, so We strengthened them with a third, and they said, \"Indeed, we are messengers to you"}},{"ar":"عِزّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"honor, power","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":81,"p":8,"ar":["وَٱتَّخَذُوا۟","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","ءَالِهَةً","لِّيَكُونُوا۟","لَهُمْ",